  "title": "Bracket token types",
  "summary": "The angle brackets of template arguments and parameters are `bracket` tokens",
  "prose": "They are told apart from the comparisons an editor's grammar takes them\nfor. Parentheses, square brackets and braces, which the editor matches\nitself, get no token.",
